@square_yards are fraudsters. Their sales agents are trained to mislead and cheat customers. One of their agents, Nikhil, promised us a cashback of ₹2.5 lakhs after registration. Despite repeated follow-ups, the cashback has not been provided. After the deal was closed, he started ignoring our calls and messages.

We have already filed a complaint with MahaRERA (Maharashtra RERA) and also will login a police complaint under Section 420 IPC for cheating. We hold all email communications and written confirmation from Nikhil and the Square Yards team regarding the ₹2.5 lakh cashback.

⚠️ Warning: Please be very cautious when dealing with Square Yards.
